3 | Invalid | Seats -1 | Visible error; no result |  |  | 
4 | Reset / recovery | Enter invalid, then fix | Error clears; correct result |  |  | 
5 | Keyboard | Complete case 1 without a mouse | All fields reachable and labelled |  |  | 
6 | Reopen | Close and reopen the file | Opens cleanly with empty or default inputs |  |  | 

